                <ul>
                    <li>Collaborated with leading figures like Charles Babbage, assisting in refining his understanding of complex mechanical calculations.</li>
                    <li>Developed a strong foundation in calculus and advanced algebra under the guidance of Augustus De Morgan.</li>
